  "version": 1,
  "name": "Drakath, Champion of Chaos",
  "description": "Three-phase chaos finale. Phase I: Drakath cycles Bulwark (75% damage reduction; Shatter the Armor removes it), Leech (heals 25 per living hero at round end unless someone Severs the Tether) and Storm (40 to all; Brace takes 70% less). At 50% HP his armor shatters. Phase II: kill the Flame, Madness and Stone Shards, which burn, weaken and petrify on hit. While any Shard lives, Drakath has a 90% Chaos Ward, and Shatter can strip it for a burst. Phase III: survive 6 rounds of an escalating Drakath using harsher forms, or kill him for a bigger reward. His shields scale with party size. Next: survived or destroyed. Failure: any phase times out.",
  "entry": "chaos_gate",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "chaos_gate",
      "kind": "scene",
      "title": "The Chaos Rift",
      "text": "The sky tears open. From the wound steps **Drakath, Champion of Chaos**, armor shifting between shapes that should not exist.\n\n\"You came without your precious elements to hide behind? *Delightful.*\"\n\nHe cycles through three **Chaos Forms**, one per round:\n🛡️ **Bulwark**: his armor turns aside most damage. One hero should **Shatter the Armor**.\n🩸 **Leech**: he heals at round end unless someone **Severs the Tether**.\n🌪️ **Storm**: a storm hits everyone at round end. **Brace**!",
      "next": "drakath_p1",
      "rules": []
    },
